     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div>Hello!<br><br></div>I have just got a new laptop with Windows 10 in it. I installed RStudio and when I run the Geomorph package and attempt to visualize warpings, every new warp opens in the same RGL and it gets difficult to operate. This does not happen in my Windows 10 computer (each warp hat its own RGL window). <br><br></div>Does anyone have a comment on this? There might be a setting of RGL that I am missing, but I cannot find it.<br><br></div>Thanks in advance,<br></div>Viviana<br clear=\"all\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><br>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#444444\"><b><br>Viviana Toro-Ibacache DDS MSc PhD</b></font><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Profesora Asistente <i>(Assistant Professor)</i><br></font><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\">Centro de Análisis Cuantitativo en Antropología Dental (CA2)</font><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Unidad de Anatomía, Instituto de Investigación en Ciencias Odontológicas</font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\">Facultad de Odontología Universidad de Chile</span><br></div><div><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Dirección:  Sergio Livingstone Pohlhammer 943</font></div><div><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\">(address)</i><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">   Independencia, Región Metropolitana</font></div><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">          