    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div><div>Dear Abel and Antigoni,<br><br></div>I tried both now. &quot;Add&quot; does not work. It does not send me any error, but indeed I tried with add=FALSE and add=TRUE to see the difference. There wasn&#39;t any. I am looking further into the arguments to see what I can find. <br><br></div>The second suggestion, using rgl.open() does the trick. I have to use it before any function opening a scene, and also use <a href=\"http://rgl.bg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rgl.bg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486051296000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0B-AN3aq5HV70ItZq4p_bQ\">rgl.bg</a> to set the background color (default seems to be grey, which interferes with the warpings), but once my sripts are dited accordingly, it should not be of any trouble.<br><br></div>Thanks to you both. This helped a lot, and if you can think of any other argument to add in the plotRefToTarget function to do this, please let me know .<br><br></div>Best wishes,<br></div>Viviana<br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2017-08-25 13:43 GMT+02:00 Antigoni Kaliontzopoulou <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ant...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<br></div></div>"
    ],
